            <title>[ZEPPELIN-541] Increase application logging</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-541</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Errors are being subsumed, in printstacktrace, in static methods. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Typically this happens during (for example) creation of spark context. Pattern is observed inside - PySparkInterpreter, SparkInterpreter etc.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
